    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats, or weight loss since surgery</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No toothache or gum bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in bowel habit or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms; no sexual concerns</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild tightness at the end of left shoulder movement; no bone pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Scar healed; no new skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Numbness under the left arm since surgery; no weakness or tingling in the hands or feet</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood fair to good; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic and lymphatic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No arm swelling or easy bruising</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

