    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes before chemotherapy, with his consent. He named a health care agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He said that what matters most to him is getting through treatment, keeping working, and having his privacy respected. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly and with any change in his health. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>
    </structuredBody>
  </component>
</ClinicalDocument>
